@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Notice"; }
<div class="container section narrow">
  <h1>Privacy Notice and Terms of Use</h1>
  <p class="small text-muted-ry">Draft prepared with the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA) in mind. Have this reviewed and approved by RebuildYOU's Information Officer before go-live.</p>
  <h2 class="h5">What we collect</h2><p>Your name, email address, mobile number, city, education level, employment status, career and training interests, your uploaded CV and your job applications. We do not ask for ID numbers or other unnecessary details.</p>
  <h2 class="h5">Why we collect it</h2><p>To create and secure your account, match you with training and opportunities, process your applications and communicate with you about them.</p>
  <h2 class="h5">Who can see it</h2><p>You, and authorised RebuildYOU administrators who need the information to run the service. Administrator access to CVs is logged. Where you apply to an employer, your application details may be shared with that employer only for that purpose.</p>
  <h2 class="h5">How we protect it</h2><p>Passwords are stored as one-way hashes. CVs are kept in private storage that cannot be reached by a web address. Access is restricted by role.</p>
  <h2 class="h5">Your rights</h2><p>You may ask to see, correct or delete your personal information, or withdraw your account, by contacting us on the details on the Contact page. You may also delete your CV at any time from your dashboard.</p>
  <h2 class="h5">Terms</h2><p>Applying through this website does not guarantee employment or a place on a programme. You confirm that the information you provide is accurate.</p>
</div>
